      "value": "@{5d15715a65baa0572e9b7731|full_name}: Haha, i did too at 1st, but later on, it shown as pretty easy to control in vr and look like a floating astronaut when not activating the jetpack on the avatar. Wish they added it back though as a feature with avatar authors disabling avatar chairs if they choose so.",
