      "mergeID": "5d9a6ad8b525c85b102f5058",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Many avatar creators spent a lot of time creating these avatars for other people to have fun with them, and a lot of people did (including me). So could you please bring back the flying avatar mechanism, so other people could have fun with them and not let the avatar creator's time go in vain.",
