      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not gonna lie this would really add alot of possibilities and interesting avatars throughout the app! Like mentioned in the comments, there are methods world creators can restrict the ability to allow chairs and prevent such methods from being exploitable in minigame style maps. However considering this is a social media platform I don't see any immediate harm with allowing people to fly in maps in the first place? There are very few competitive style maps and most are open and free roam maps. It would also give map makers an idea for Easter eggs to find using various methods of locomotion as well! Not allowing this feature is basically asking for modified clients because people are more persistent than rules say, believe me, just ask gun owners! Lmao",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
