      "value": "@{5af8fc26a97e4b511e461b1d|full_name}: That doesn't make sense, Quest is already demolished in terms of creativity. Lots of avatars were designed around rigidbodies or finalIK for leaving interactive objects (chairs/dance pedastals) on the ground. Those avatars simply don't have a Quest version, or it's implemented without properly working, so Quest is already a flaming pile of failure in this way.",
