      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a570cf1b301553d0104bddd|full_name}: Quest isn't good if it's hardware is limited in general. It's like trying to make Windows 10 have the same features as a flip phone in terms of little to no features. It will not work out as people would just try to mod Windows 10 to give it more features than the flip phone. But yeah I am proud of the devs for the fact that I am hearing more people talking about seeing if there is a modded client that will bring back self chairs if the devs won't add it back and patch the collider issue. Which what I am saying is that the devs just popularized modded client use.\n\nBut yeah, I have never been a fan of Quest as it's too early in its stages as a standalone VR headset.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
