      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is such BS this isn't even game breaking. If someone wants to clip around, let them. If people don't like them doing that, let them know. If they persist, kick them. If it's their own private instance, who gives a rat's ass what they do in it? Is it really that hard to understand. \n\nTupper even stated in reply to one of these that 'we want world creators to retain control of their creations' which is basically akin to saying that world creators should be able to say 'you can only enjoy this world the way I TELL you to and no other way, even in private instances'.",
