      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: My world had the avatar pedistal of 2 models that used self chairs and told people to \"Go Explore the whole map and tell me if you find anything you never seen before\" as i was using the self chairs in my world myself to spread self chairs as much as possible.\n\nIf world makers dont want it soo bad, then ask for an option to disable self chairs in the world with \"VRC_Player Mods\" instead of pissing that it should be removed period or ask the devs to fix colliders if they dont want people to clip through colliders.",
      "viewerReactions": null
