      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's not gonna happen. VRChat's goals have never been to enrich avatar development, they want to focus solely on worlds.\n\nEven though the game thrives off its avatars more so than on its worlds, as evident by the fact that *AN EMPTY BOX* was the most popular world for over a year. This dev team is more out of touch than anything I have ever seen.",
      "viewerReactions": null
