      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: Just like chairs on avatars weren't suppose to be a thing, but people worked hard to make working cars, planes, etc.\n\nDevs will probably add it back if they see people want it and add an option to disable self chairs in worlds using the scene descriptor. I know modified clients are a no-no, but it has caused more people to move to them because of this unexpected bug occuring and not many asked for it to be removed, but treated as a feature as it has made avatar makers waste valuable time making them work.",
